abstract: >-
  An executable research atlas centered on the symplectic generalized
  quadrangle W(3,3). The repository develops exact finite-geometry,
  group-action, code, lattice, representation-theoretic, cohomological,
  contextuality, and routing constructions through named witnesses,
  machine-readable certificates, and regression tests. It also studies
  conditional bridges to exceptional structures, quantum information,
  photonic architectures, and physics. Exact results, software and
  simulations, proposed experiments, conditional interpretations, and
  failed or superseded claims are explicitly separated.

